      "text": "SINCE 2015",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">SINCE 2015</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "In every reflection, curve, and blur of motion lies a story of speed — paused in a single frame. This portfolio captures the soul of machines, the tension between movement and stillness, where energy meets silence. It’s a celebration of design and momentum — a moment where power, beauty, and stillness become one.",
